### obtener computadoras
GET http://localhost:3000/api/computers


#### obtener una computadora
GET http://localhost:3000/api/computers/6a5ed202190abaababd1be37

### Cargar nueva computadora
POST http://localhost:3000/api/computers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": "PcGamer",
  "description": "Rtx 3080ti + Ryzen 7 5700x",
  "pcNumber": 1,
  "price": 1000,
  "id": "6a5ece301a9b3155cab3e3f1"
}

###modificar computadora
put http://localhost:3000/api/computers/6a5ed55b3c5bd3dcbdf068c1
Content-Type: application/json

  {
    "category": "PcGamer",
    "description": "Rtx 308011ti + Ryzen 7 5700x",
    "price": 10200,
    "pcNumber": 1,
    "status": false
  }

###modificar parcialmente computadora
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/computers/6a5ed3a4392b98e6359c5250
Content-Type: application/json

  {
    "category": "PcGamer",
      "description": "Rtx 3080ti + Ryzen 7 5700x",
      "price": 1000,
      "pcNumber": 21,
      "status": false
  }
#### Eliminar computadora
delete http://localhost:3000/api/computers/6a5ed22d190abaababd1be38

